.TH SBSIGLIST "1" "January 2026" "sbsiglist 0.9.5" "User Commands"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
sbsiglist \- Create EFI_SIGNATURE_LIST signature databases
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B sbsiglist
[\fI\,options\/\fR] \fI\,--owner <guid> --type <type> <sig-file>\/\fR
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Create an EFI_SIGNATURE_LIST from a signature file
Options:
.TP
\fB\-\-owner\fR <guid>
Signature owner GUID
.TP
\fB\-\-type\fR <type>
Signature type. One of:
x509
sha256
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR <file>
write signed data to <file>
(default <sig\-file>.siglist)
